      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yeah, and if your bounds size isn't somewhat large, the game un-renders your avatar parts. Imagine a friend comes over to you, stands beside you, and they see your pants disappear. You're standing there in undies. Why? oops, \"update when offscreen\" was checked and doesn't work! gotta uncheck that and give your shorts LARGE bounds to make sure they don't get de-rendered",
